    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐζων-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marauding by light-armed men</i>,
			used for Heb.<u>Gad</u> (<i><span class="en">
				Phoen.
			</span></i> deity, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τύχη</span>
			) by <i><span class="en">
				Aq.
				<u>Ge.</u>
				30.11
			</span></i>, with ref. to the play on <i>gādh</i> (quasi
			'marauding band') ib.<i><span class="en">
				49.19
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐζων-ίζω</span></b> , ibid.</div>
